{"seq":1,"slug":"matching-methods","title":"匹配方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/observational-methods/matching-methods","wordCount":1466,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"匹配方法\">匹配方法</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>匹配方法（Matching Methods）是观测性因果推断中最直觉的方法族：对于每个接受处理的个体，从未处理个体中找到在协变量上最&quot;相似&quot;的一个或多个个体作为对照，通过比较匹配对之间的结果差异来估计因果效应。匹配方法的核心假设是条件独立性假设（Conditional Independence Assumption, CIA）——在控制了所有可观测的混杂变量后，处理分配与潜在结果独立。换言之，匹配方法假设&quot;没有未观测的混杂因素&quot;。这是一个不可检验但可以通过领域知识来论证其合理性的假设。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[观测数据] --&gt; B[处理组]&#10;    A --&gt; C[对照组]&#10;    B --&gt; D[提取协变量 X]&#10;    C --&gt; E[提取协变量 X]&#10;    D --&gt; F{匹配算法}&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[匹配对]&#10;    G --&gt; H[比较结果差异]&#10;    H --&gt; I[估计 ATT]&#10;    subgraph 关键假设&#10;        J[条件独立: Y0,Y1 ⊥ T 给定 X]&#10;        K[共同支撑: 0 &lt; P T=1 给定 X &lt; 1]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[观测数据] --&gt; B[处理组]\n    A --&gt; C[对照组]\n    B --&gt; D[提取协变量 X]\n    C --&gt; E[提取协变量 X]\n    D --&gt; F{匹配算法}\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[匹配对]\n    G --&gt; H[比较结果差异]\n    H --&gt; I[估计 ATT]\n    subgraph 关键假设\n        J[条件独立: Y0,Y1 ⊥ T 给定 X]\n        K[共同支撑: 0 &lt; P T=1 给定 X &lt; 1]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>匹配方法</th>\n<th>匹配维度</th>\n<th>核心技术</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确匹配</td>\n<td>原始协变量</td>\n<td>逐一匹配</td>\n<td>无模型假设</td>\n<td>维度灾难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>倾向得分匹配(PSM)</td>\n<td>得分标量</td>\n<td>Logistic回归</td>\n<td>降维匹配</td>\n<td>模型依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>马氏距离匹配</td>\n<td>距离标量</td>\n<td>马氏距离</td>\n<td>协方差加权</td>\n<td>对离群值敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粗化精确匹配(CEM)</td>\n<td>粗化协变量</td>\n<td>分箱匹配</td>\n<td>平衡可控</td>\n<td>粗化粒度选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遗传匹配</td>\n<td>加权距离</td>\n<td>遗传算法</td>\n<td>自动权重优化</td>\n<td>计算量大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"倾向得分匹配\">倾向得分匹配</h2><p>倾向得分匹配（Propensity Score Matching, PSM）是观测性因果推断中最广泛使用的匹配方法。倾向得分 e(X) = P(T=1|X) 是给定协变量 X 时个体接受处理的概率。Rosenbaum 和 Rubin (1983) 证明了一个关键定理：如果条件独立性假设在给定 X 时成立，则在给定 e(X) 时也成立。这意味着匹配可以从高维协变量空间降低到一维倾向得分空间。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;from sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression&#10;from sklearn.neighbors import NearestNeighbors&#10;&#10;np.random.seed(42)&#10;n = 2000&#10;&#10;age = np.random.normal(35, 10, n)&#10;income = np.random.normal(50000, 15000, n)&#10;education = np.random.choice([0, 1, 2], n, p=[0.3, 0.5, 0.2])&#10;&#10;logit = -3 + 0.05 * age + 0.00003 * income + 0.5 * education&#10;prob = 1 / (1 + np.exp(-logit))&#10;treatment = np.random.binomial(1, prob)&#10;&#10;y0 = 100 + 0.5 * age + 0.001 * income + 10 * education + np.random.normal(0, 10, n)&#10;treatment_effect = 15&#10;y = y0 + treatment_effect * treatment&#10;&#10;X = np.column_stack([age, income, education])&#10;ps_model = LogisticRegression(max_iter=1000).fit(X, treatment)&#10;ps = ps_model.predict_proba(X)[:, 1]&#10;&#10;treated_idx = np.where(treatment == 1)[0]&#10;control_idx = np.where(treatment == 0)[0]&#10;&#10;nn = NearestNeighbors(n_neighbors=1, metric=&#39;euclidean&#39;)&#10;nn.fit(ps[control_idx].reshape(-1, 1))&#10;distances, indices = nn.kneighbors(ps[treated_idx].reshape(-1, 1))&#10;&#10;matched_control_idx = control_idx[indices.flatten()]&#10;att = np.mean(y[treated_idx] - y[matched_control_idx])&#10;print(f&quot;PSM estimated ATT: {att:.2f}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;True treatment effect: {treatment_effect}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.linear_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LogisticRegression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.neighbors </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NearestNeighbors</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">np.random.seed(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.normal(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">35</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">income </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.normal(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n)</span></span>\